WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.848
The browser lab uses five small synthetic tables The
admissions table

00:00:05.874 --> 00:00:11.508
gives us patient admissions diagnoses and admission
and discharge times The sales

00:00:11.521 --> 00:00:17.377
table gives us products quantities prices categories
and dates Employees

00:00:17.403 --> 00:00:22.995
is useful for salary and department examples Product
sales is intentionally small

00:00:23.021 --> 00:00:26.640
so that subtotals from ROLLUP CUBE and GROUPING SETS
are easy to

00:00:26.653 --> 00:00:32.166
inspect Grades gives us course semester grade and
enrollment examples

00:00:34.027 --> 00:00:39.845
These are teaching datasets so you can experiment
freely The PostgreSQL database

00:00:39.871 --> 00:00:44.853
runs in the browser and can be reset Do not paste
real

00:00:44.866 --> 00:00:49.790
confidential or production data into the browser
editor The goal here is

00:00:49.803 --> 00:00:52.461
to learn the SQL pattern with safe practice data
